Papadoggg@hotmail.com (DokktorWho222) wrote:

>Hey guys... I've been trying to figure out how in the hell i can get
>Nethack to start in the VGA video mode. Everytime i play, it opens a
>fullscreen DOS screen, but the game only wants to use half of the
>screen. I've been looking through the Guidebook and i've been
>tinkering with the defaults, but nothing i do seems to work. 

The Windows console version does not support graphics. If you are using
the official Windows distribution, you can also get a windowed display
(with graphical or classical view; switch with F5) running
'nethackw.exe'. The DOS version can be put into graphics mode by setting
the line
	OPTIONS=video:autodetect
in the configurations file.

